// ?namespaces=common,home) instead of sending every individual key; this map
// is what lets publicController.getSite resolve those namespace names back
// into the TextContent fields to select.
//
// KEEP IN SYNC: whenever a namespace or key is added/removed on the
// frontend, copy the same change here (the object body below is a verbatim
// copy of the frontend one). The `satisfies` clause makes tsc reject any key
// that isn't a real field on Models/TextContent.ts, so a key added on the
// frontend must also be added to that model.
